      <title>Breakfast Wrap: Australia rocked by attack on Dr Helen Haines</title>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;How are representatives across the political spectrum digesting news of an attack on an Australian politician?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Today's episode of the Breakfast Wrap hears from the bystander who intervened in Wangaratta, the town's Mayor, as well as independent federal politicians, the government and the opposition, the House Speaker and historical context from Michelle Grattan. &lt;/p&gt;</description>
